{"task": "三班都有哪些学员？", "expect_tools": ["find_students"], "forbid_tools": [], "notes": "按班级查学员→find_students(class_name)，忌先 list_my_classes 绕路"}
{"task": "我带的学员里谁的课时最少？", "expect_tools": ["find_students"], "forbid_tools": ["sql_query", "sql_list_tables"], "notes": "现成工具可解，禁 sql 三件套"}
